    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, thanks. It's not bad, but it's a little plain. I think it needs more... weight. You know, more of that emotional punch that makes people actually feel something when they hear it.\n\nI just ran that through the tool, and the Inspiration Score came back pretty low—it's basically just flagging a lack of descriptive power. I need you to beef it up. Try to make it more evocative and powerful. Just a reminder though: make sure it still actually makes sense as a speech. I don't want it to turn into a word salad of adjectives, it still has to feel authentic to the candidate. Can you try a second draft with a bit more descriptive energy?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
